CITY OF CHEYENNE
CONTRACT MODIFICATION

Contract Modification:
#1
Project:

Belvoir Ranch Grazing Lease Agreement
Project Number:

Contract #6957
Contractor:

Wyoming Cattle Co., LLC
Date Prepared:

1-4-2022

The above reference contract is hereby modified in the manner set forth in the following and
such amendments and modifications are agreed to by the undersigned, being parties to this
contract and agreement.  All other aspects of the agreement remain unchanged and in full force
and effect.

I.
Description of Changes:

This modification extends the Lease for one additional three-year period as outlined in paragraph
2, Term of Lease, commencing on the date hereof and expiring on December 31, 2024.  This
modification also adds the Mariah Pasture comprised of 543.76 acres as shown on the attached
updated Pasture Map “Exhibit B” incorporated as the updated “Leased Premises.” The following
is the legal description of the Mariah Pasture:

LEGAL DESCRIPTION

Township 12 North, Range 70 West of the 6th P.M., Laramie County, Wyoming.

All of Sections 11 and 14, lying north of the Union Pacific Railroad right of way.

II.
Approvals

Date:  _____________

City of Cheyenne

_______________________________________/_________________________________
Patrick Collins, Mayor                                           /ATTEST:  Kristina F. Jones, City Clerk

_________________________________________________________________________
Recommend Approval by Public Works Director
By Stefanie Boster at 10:02 pm, Jan 06, 2022
